---
title: Broccoli Alfredo
source: Matt
servings: 4
prep time: 0 minutes
cook time: 45 minutes
---

Add @penne pasta{1%lbs}, @minced garlic{2%tbsp}, @salt{1%tsp}, @black pepper{1/4%tsp}, @olive oil{1%tbsp}, and @chicken stock{4%cups} to a #large skillet{}.

Bring the pan to a boil over high heat, then cook the pasta for ~{6%minutes}.

Add @broccoli{1%head}(chopped) and @butter{4%tbsp}, then cook for another ~{3%minutes}.

Lower heat to low and mix.

Add @heavy cream{1%cup} and @parmesan cheese{3/4%cups}, then cook for another ~{3%minutes}.

Season with additional salt and pepper if needed.
